"Codex live-quota tracking follows the authoritative `~/.codex/auth.json` session directly and does not create a second Keychain copy. A legacy CodeBurn Keychain item, when present, is read only as a migration fallback. Only ChatGPT-mode auth (Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise) is supported. API-key users are billed per request and have a different reporting surface. Credit-metered workspaces report no rate-limit windows, so their monthly credit allowance is shown instead." = "Codex 實時配額追蹤直接沿用權威的 `~/.codex/auth.json` 會話，不會建立第二份鑰匙串副本。若存在舊版 CodeBurn 鑰匙串專案，僅作為遷移回退讀取。僅支援 ChatGPT 模式認證（Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise）。使用 API 金鑰的使用者按請求計費，報告方式不同。按點數計量的工作區不報告限流視窗，因此會改為顯示其每月點數額度。";
