"Kimi Code live-quota tracking reads `~/.kimi-code/credentials/kimi-code.json` directly. Nothing is copied or stored. Access tokens are short-lived (~15 minutes) and only the Kimi CLI refreshes them, so if the connection shows as expired, run the Kimi CLI once and click Reconnect." = "Kimi Code 實時配額追蹤直接讀取 `~/.kimi-code/credentials/kimi-code.json`，不會複製或儲存任何內容。存取權杖有效期很短（約 15 分鐘），且只有 Kimi 命令列工具會重新整理它們；因此若連線顯示為已過期，請執行一次 Kimi 命令列工具，然後點按“重新連線”。";
