"Copilot live-quota tracking reads a GitHub token that is already on this Mac, read-only. Nothing is copied or stored. CodeBurn looks at the editor plugin files in `~/.config/github-copilot`, the Copilot CLI's `~/.copilot` files, the COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN, GH_TOKEN and GITHUB_TOKEN variables, `gh auth token`, and finally a token you paste below. Usage tracking works without any of this; only the live quota bars need a token. Every one of those carries the GitHub host it belongs to — the plugin files are keyed by host, the variables are read with GH_HOST, the `gh` login with the host in gh's own hosts.yml, and a pasted token with the host you type beside it — and a credential for a GitHub Enterprise Cloud host is queried on that tenant's own API (api.<tenant>.ghe.com), never sent to api.github.com." = "Copilot 實時配額追蹤以只讀方式讀取這臺 Mac 上已有的 GitHub 權杖，不會複製或儲存任何內容。CodeBurn 會依次檢視 `~/.config/github-copilot` 中的編輯器外掛檔案、Copilot 命令列工具的 `~/.copilot` 檔案、COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN、GH_TOKEN 和 GITHUB_TOKEN 環境變數、`gh auth token`，最後是你在下方貼上的權杖。用量追蹤無需這些內容，只有實時配額條才需要權杖。上述每一種來源都會帶上它所屬的 GitHub 主機——外掛檔案按主機分類，環境變數透過 GH_HOST 讀取，`gh` 登入取自 gh 自己 hosts.yml 中的主機，貼上的權杖則取自你在旁邊填寫的主機——而為 GitHub Enterprise Cloud 主機找到的憑證，只會向該租戶自己的 API（api.<tenant>.ghe.com）查詢，絕不會傳送到 api.github.com。";
"GitHub token" = "GitHub 權杖";
"GitHub host" = "GitHub 主機";
"Save & Connect" = "儲存並連線";
"Clear Token" = "清除權杖";
"Paste a token" = "貼上權杖";
"Optional, and only needed when nothing else on this Mac is signed in. A fine-grained personal access token with the \"Plan: Read-only\" permission is enough. Leave the host at github.com unless the token was minted on a GitHub Enterprise Cloud tenant, in which case enter that tenant's host (<tenant>.ghe.com) so the token is never sent to api.github.com. Both are saved in CodeBurn's own Keychain item and are used only to read your Copilot quota." = "可選，僅當這臺 Mac 上沒有其他已登入來源時才需要。一個具有 \"Plan: Read-only\" 許可權的細粒度個人存取權杖即可。主機請保持為 github.com，除非該權杖是在 GitHub Enterprise Cloud 租戶上簽發的；若是，請填入該租戶的主機（<tenant>.ghe.com），這樣權杖就絕不會傳送到 api.github.com。兩者都儲存在 CodeBurn 自己的鑰匙串專案中，且僅用於讀取你的 Copilot 配額。";
